screen and (min-width:780px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left{margin-left:10px;border-left:2px solid #3d3d3d!important;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-right:10px;border-left:0!important;border-right:2px solid #3d3d3d;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:3}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:1}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:2;grid-column:2}}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{margin-left:auto;margin-right:32px;font-size:smaller;font-weight:bold}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{font-size:300%;font-family:serif;color:#3d3d3d;line-height:1em}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin{margin-bottom:auto;margin-right:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{margin-top:auto;margin-left:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text{font-style:italic}</style><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote\" style=\"justify-content: center\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left\" style=\"display: inline-block; height: calc(70px + 2*4px); width: calc(70px + 2*4px); clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 50%, 50% 100%, 0% 50%); background: black;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; margin: 4px; width: 70px; height: 70px; clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 50%, 50% 100%, 0% 50%);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ce/Portrait_%27Plumes%27_Fronkin.png/70px-Portrait_%27Plumes%27_Fronkin.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ce/Portrait_%27Plumes%27_Fronkin.png/105px-Portrait_%27Plumes%27_Fronkin.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ce/Portrait_%27Plumes%27_Fronkin.png/140px-Portrait_%27Plumes%27_Fronkin.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ce/Portrait_%27Plumes%27_Fronkin.png/70px-Portrait_%27Plumes%27_Fronkin.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/ce/Portrait_%27Plumes%27_Fronkin.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><blockquote style=\"font-size: 100%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">I saw a Steel Watcher rip some poor sod clean in two - I guess we need that sort of thing on our side, the way things are going.</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author\">— <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">'Plumes' Fronkin</a></div><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Act_Three\">Act Three</span></h3>\n<p>'Plumes' Fronkin stands in the plaza between <a href=\"/wiki/Elfsong_Tavern\" title=\"Elfsong Tavern\">Elfsong Tavern</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Mouth\" title=\"Baldur's Mouth\">Baldur's Mouth</a>. He is listening to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Augur_Harxkellan\" title=\"Augur Harxkellan\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ed/Portrait_Augur_Harxkellan.png/25px-Portrait_Augur_Harxkellan.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ed/Portrait_Augur_Harxkellan.png/38px-Portrait_Augur_Harxkellan.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ed/Portrait_Augur_Harxkellan.png/50px-Portrait_Augur_Harxkellan.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Augur Harxkellan's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ed/Portrait_Augur_Harxkellan.png/25px-Portrait_Augur_Harxkellan.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ed/Portrait_Augur_Harxkellan.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Augur_Harxkellan\" title=\"Augur Harxkellan\">Augur Harxkellan's</a> speech on the city's savior <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Enver_Gortash\" title=\"Enver Gortash\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png/25px-Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png/38px-Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png/50px-Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lord Gortash\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png/25px-Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/59/Portrait_Enver_Gortash.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Enver_Gortash\" title=\"Enver Gortash\">Lord Gortash</a>. Fronkin does not join in with the crowd and appears to reluctantly support Gortash, stating: \"I don't really agree with Lord Gortash's methods, but the man does get things done.\"\n</p><p>If Gortash is defeated, Fronkin and the rest of the crowd disappear, and are not seen again.\n</p>\n<div class=\"navbox-styles\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r138587\">.mw-parser-output .hlist dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dl,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist ul{margin:0;padding:0}.mw-parser-output .hlist dl ul,.mw-parser-output .hlist dl dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul ul,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dl ul,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dl dl,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist ul dl,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist ul ul{display:inline}.mw-parser-output .hlist dd,.mw-parser-outp